<title>UK: Nigeria raises Aug term crude prices - trade.</title>
<headline>Nigeria raises Aug term crude prices - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nigerian National Petroleum Corp raised crude contract formula prices for August by between five and 15 cents a barrel, trade sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Following are new prices for August versus benchmark dated Brent</p>
<p>		    August	July	 change</p>
<p>Bonny Light    +35 cts     +26 cts   up  9 cts</p>
<p>Qua Iboe	 +35 cts     +26 cts   up  9 cts</p>
<p>Forcados	 +15 cts     +10 cts   up  5 cts</p>
<p>Escravos	 +33 cts     +19 cts   up 14 cts</p>
<p>Brass River    +38 cts     +31 cts   up  8 cts</p>
<p>Pennington     +65 cts     +56 cts   up 10 cts</p>
<p>Bonny Medium   +05 cts     parity    up  5 cts</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
